  "design": {
    "idea": "ACT V \u2014 CURTAIN CALL (Boss: THE UNDERSTUDY): All 8 moves start restored, then each phase The Understudy snatches one move (Throw -> Dash -> Bolt) into an orbiting Spotlight Mask; shatter each Mask for a 2.0s standing-ovation stagger and instant move restore to shatter the empty cloak and claim Half-Lantern #7B!",
    "kind": "boss",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Synthesizing every Act's counterplay mid-duel as Throw, Dash, and Bolt are stolen in sequence and reclaimed through hovering Spotlight Masks.",
    "decisions": 8,
    "expert_s": 130,
    "reward": "theatre_cleared+half_lantern_7b",
    "why": "Climactic Act V boss duel of The Doppel Theatre awarding Half-Lantern #7B and opening the return curtain to Velvet Promenade.",
